<enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133804669,imgsize-732671.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1844, a Mexican land grant covered an 80,000-acre ranch; access fight continues centuries later]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133755132.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Cielo Vista Ranch in Colorado is at the centre of a land dispute dating to the 1844 Sangre de Cristo Land Grant. The 80,000-acre property has been the subject of decades of legal battles over access rights for land grant heirs. Governor Jared Polis has now appointed Ken Salazar as a special envoy to help the heirs, community and property owner find a way forward.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1844-a-mexican-land-grant-gave-settlers-rights-across-what-is-now-an-80000-acre-colorado-ranch-nearly-two-centuries-later-the-access-fight-has-become-the-states-longest-running-land-dispute/articleshow/133755132.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1844-a-mexican-land-grant-gave-settlers-rights-across-what-is-now-an-80000-acre-colorado-ranch-nearly-two-centuries-later-the-access-fight-has-become-the-states-longest-running-land-dispute/articleshow/133755132.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T19:00:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133756713,imgsize-128038.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[North Carolina mission school land protected after 184 years through new easement]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133797971.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1842-a-north-carolina-mission-school-began-on-mountain-farmland-184-years-later-an-86-7-acre-easement-completes-protection-of-land-stewarded-there-for-130-years/articleshow/133797971.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1842-a-north-carolina-mission-school-began-on-mountain-farmland-184-years-later-an-86-7-acre-easement-completes-protection-of-land-stewarded-there-for-130-years/articleshow/133797971.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T19:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133798229,imgsize-104759.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Millions of hours of Ukraine drone data being used to train AI: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133801734.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/millions-of-hours-of-ukraine-drone-data-being-used-to-train-ai-report/articleshow/133801734.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/millions-of-hours-of-ukraine-drone-data-being-used-to-train-ai-report/articleshow/133801734.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T18:53:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133803032,imgsize-222238.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[H-1B petitions denied, visas revoked: USCIS says a 'major IT consulting' company in Vermont was doing this fraud]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133802323.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/h-1b-petitions-denied-visas-revoked-uscis-says-a-major-it-consulting-company-in-vermont-was-doing-this-fraud/articleshow/133802323.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/h-1b-petitions-denied-visas-revoked-uscis-says-a-major-it-consulting-company-in-vermont-was-doing-this-fraud/articleshow/133802323.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T18:35:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133802468,imgsize-829693.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Michigan used 7,000+ recycled tires in Ellsworth Road paving; the project later won a national award]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133793722.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Michigan's latest eco-friendly endeavor involves transforming thousands of old tires into rubber-modified asphalt for road building. Over 7,000 scrap tires have been repurposed on Ellsworth Road in Pittsfield Township, with researchers evaluating how this new asphalt stacks up against conventional materials. The initiative has earned a prestigious national award for its commitment to sustainability and effective recycling of resources, aiming to tackle tire waste while boosting road durability.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2025-michigan-recycled-more-than-7000-scrap-tires-into-0-8-miles-of-ellsworth-road-the-project-later-won-a-national-green-construction-award/articleshow/133793722.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2025-michigan-recycled-more-than-7000-scrap-tires-into-0-8-miles-of-ellsworth-road-the-project-later-won-a-national-green-construction-award/articleshow/133793722.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T18:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133794147,imgsize-2224548.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Florida Keys island heirs win decades-long fight over right to build after 70 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133793346.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1956-a-doctor-bought-a-7-9-acre-florida-keys-island-from-the-us-at-auction-with-residential-zoning-70-years-later-his-heirs-won-a-decades-long-fight-over-their-right-to-build/articleshow/133793346.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1956-a-doctor-bought-a-7-9-acre-florida-keys-island-from-the-us-at-auction-with-residential-zoning-70-years-later-his-heirs-won-a-decades-long-fight-over-their-right-to-build/articleshow/133793346.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T18:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133793636,imgsize-201642.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Putin orders 3-day pause in strikes on Kyiv as US delegation arrives in Russia]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133800664.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US special representatives Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner arrived in Moscow for crucial peace talks. President Putin ordered a three-day halt to strikes on Kyiv for the American delegation's visit. Both Russia and Ukraine had intensified long-range attacks before this diplomatic engagement. The US push aims to revive efforts to end the ongoing conflict between the nations. The envoys will travel to Ukraine after concluding their discussions in Russia.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/putin-orders-3-day-pause-in-strikes-on-kyiv-as-us-delegation-arrives-in-russia/articleshow/133800664.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/putin-orders-3-day-pause-in-strikes-on-kyiv-as-us-delegation-arrives-in-russia/articleshow/133800664.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T17:44:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133800781,imgsize-65832.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US mom hanged 2-year-old son after discussing Lindsay Clancy case with friends, called him ‘anti-Christ’]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133799874.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mom-hanged-2-year-old-son-after-discussing-lindsay-clancy-case-with-friends-called-him-anti-christ/articleshow/133799874.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mom-hanged-2-year-old-son-after-discussing-lindsay-clancy-case-with-friends-called-him-anti-christ/articleshow/133799874.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T17:40:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133800638,imgsize-549802.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Arthur Lundeen? Arizona man duct-taped to seat on American Airlines flight after alleged racist outburst]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133800160.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-arthur-lundeen-arizona-man-duct-taped-to-seat-on-american-airlines-flight-after-alleged-racist-outburst/articleshow/133800160.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-arthur-lundeen-arizona-man-duct-taped-to-seat-on-american-airlines-flight-after-alleged-racist-outburst/articleshow/133800160.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T17:28:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133800235,imgsize-85886.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Stop the boats’: Masked men block roads to Dover port in anti-immigration protest]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133798997.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Masked men blocked roads leading to Britain's busiest ferry port in Dover. This protest disrupted traffic around the major cross-Channel hub on Saturday morning. Port officials stated that all traffic in and out of the port had been stopped. Videos showed several dozen men dressed in black, shouting "stop the boats". The incident appeared to be an anti-immigration protest, causing significant traffic jams.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/stop-the-boats-masked-men-block-roads-to-dover-port-in-anti-immigration-protest/articleshow/133798997.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/stop-the-boats-masked-men-block-roads-to-dover-port-in-anti-immigration-protest/articleshow/133798997.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T17:13:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133799673,imgsize-853152.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In the late 1920s, mule deer were brought to Catalina Island; now a judge has ordered for 2,000 of them to be culled]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133792723.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Catalina Island's mule deer, released in the late 1920s, now pose serious threats to local flora and contribute to increased wildfire risks. In response, conservation leaders have outlined a contentious strategy to significantly reduce the mule deer population. Following a legal challenge that was dismissed by a judge, the cull is set to commence, aimed at preserving the island's natural environment and lowering fire hazards.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-the-late-1920s-mule-deer-were-brought-to-catalina-island-now-a-judge-has-ordered-2500-of-them-to-be-culled/articleshow/133792723.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-the-late-1920s-mule-deer-were-brought-to-catalina-island-now-a-judge-has-ordered-2500-of-them-to-be-culled/articleshow/133792723.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T17:04:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133792866,imgsize-1368818.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[German tourist returns 2,400-year-old Ancient Olympia artifact after 50 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133791904.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-german-tourist-took-a-2400-year-old-piece-of-ancient-olympia-home-in-the-1960s-more-than-50-years-later-she-returned-it-to-the-birthplace-of-the-olympic-games/articleshow/133791904.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-german-tourist-took-a-2400-year-old-piece-of-ancient-olympia-home-in-the-1960s-more-than-50-years-later-she-returned-it-to-the-birthplace-of-the-olympic-games/articleshow/133791904.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T17:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133792084,imgsize-72444.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Taiwan faces alarming Chinese presence around its territory]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133797324.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Taiwan reported significant Chinese military incursions around its territory on Saturday.  Up to twenty Chinese aircraft and several naval vessels were detected by Taiwan's defense ministry.  Many of these aircraft crossed the median line into Taiwan's air defense zone.  This surge follows recent days of increased Chinese naval and air presence.  Taiwan's Coast Guard Administration noted a substantial rise in Chinese vessels last month.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/nearly-eight-vessels-per-day-taiwan-faces-alarming-chinese-presence-around-its-territory/articleshow/133797324.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/nearly-eight-vessels-per-day-taiwan-faces-alarming-chinese-presence-around-its-territory/articleshow/133797324.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T16:05:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133797432,imgsize-42962.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Sandy Dosanjh? Wife of VPD officer Kal Dosanjh, removed as Surrey council candidate after husband’s arrest]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133796743.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/who-is-sandy-dosanjh-wife-of-vpd